records_to_check.source:
Quickly plucking ten of your oddities from your pack, Urmpfh dances in place excitedly, throwing the numenera up in the air where they disappear in an instant.

"Much good." A pool of shins grows in the palms of Urmpfh's hands, which he pours into your pack before handing it back to you. "Business concluded."

{SCRIPT: removes ten most valuable oddities from inventory, adds 150% of full value in shins to inventory}
{SCRIPT: I'm open to different ways to do this, perhaps it can open up a barter interface but limit what the player can sell or how much shins Urmpfh has? Maybe it'd be easier to do with cyphers. Whichever way it's easiest to do, design can be flexible}

records_to_check.translation:
乌尔姆普夫迅速从你的背包里拈出十件奇物，兴奋地原地起舞，把那些扭蒙拉抛向空中，它们转瞬便消失了。

“很好。”乌尔姆普夫的掌心积起一堆辛币，他把辛币倒进你的背包，然后将背包递还给你。“买卖成交。”

{SCRIPT: removes ten most valuable oddities from inventory, adds 150% of full value in shins to inventory}
